@@ -0,0 +1,25 @@
+---
+id: dl-003-validate-task-input-before-mutations
+type: decision-log
+title: "Validate task input before mutations"
+status: pending
+format: 1
+---
+
+## Context
+
+The public task-list API previously accepted malformed titles, priorities, and tags. Creating a task
+could therefore store invalid values, while rename and tag could update an existing task before callers
+could report input errors.
+
+## Decision
+
+Validate task input at the task-list API boundary before creating a task, reading the time provider, or
+applying a rename or tag mutation. Return the existing `Result` shape with the `invalid-input` error code
+and a field-specific message.
+
+## Consequences
+
+All API consumers receive uniform validation failures and rejected operations leave IDs, tasks, and
+timestamps unchanged. The domain remains deterministic and callers can display the returned message
+directly.
