@@ -0,0 +1,20 @@
+---
+id: task-003-validate-task-input
+type: task
+title: "Validate task input"
+status: pending
+format: 1
+---
+
+Validated all externally supplied task values before a task can be created or changed. Titles now reject
+blank values and titles longer than 120 characters. Adds reject priorities outside `low`, `normal`, and
+`high`, while adds and tag operations reject empty tags and tags containing spaces.
+
+Failures return `invalid-input` results with messages that identify the invalid field and leave the
+stored list unchanged. Validation happens before timestamps are read or task state is written.
+
+## Verification
+
+The new validation behavior was tested red-first. The initial test run failed because invalid inputs were
+accepted. `npm test` now passes all 17 tests, including each rejected input category and list-unchanged
+checks for add, rename, and tag operations.
